------------------------------------------------------------------------------
llm-cliche-highlighter (simonw/tools)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The structural cliche rules in src/rules/slop/cliche.rs (slop/negation-chain,
slop/dont-verb-it, slop/echo-sentences, slop/stacked-questions, slop/anaphora,
slop/stranded-auxiliary, slop/colon-triple, slop/not-but), the catalogue entries
in the "LLM cliche highlighter" section of src/rules/slop/phrases.toml (plus the
broadened heres-the-thing, important-to-note, plays-a-role and landscape
patterns), and the ported self-tests in src/rules/slop/cliche.rs are derived
from Simon Willison's LLM cliche highlighter:

  Source:    https://github.com/simonw/tools/blob/main/llm-cliche-highlighter.html
  Commit:    a48d9920ff1cf203cd0070c3e8321283df50bf11
  Files:     llm-cliche-highlighter.html (pattern list, finder helpers, self-tests)

