Voikko (Finnish spell checking)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/voikko/ is a Rust port of the spelling parts of libvoikko (corevoikko):
the VFST transducer reader, the Finnish morphological analyzer, the speller and
the typing-error suggestions. Upstream: https://github.com/voikko/corevoikko
libvoikko is tri-licensed under MPL 1.1, GPL 2 or later, and LGPL 2.1 or later;
this port is used under GPL-2.0-or-later terms, compatible with this project's
GPL-3.0-or-later.

dictionaries/fi/mor.vfst.zlib is the voikko-fi 2.6 (mor-standard) Finnish
morphology, GPL-2.0-or-later. Copyright (C) 2006-2026 Hannu Väisänen,
Harri Pitkänen, Teemu Likonen and the other voikko-fi contributors. Details in
dictionaries/fi/license.

